# Private keys / secrets — never commit.
# infra/gateway/README.md tells you to run `openssl genrsa -out platform-jwt.pem`
# inside infra/gateway/; that key MINTS tenant-scoped platform JWTs and is the
# entire tenant-isolation boundary, so it must never be committable.
*.pem
*.key
platform-jwt.pub
